# Run this project with Cargo

- **GUI:** from project root, `cargo run -p app` (add `--release` for faster export).
- **CLI:** `cargo run -p app -- <folder> --strip …` (requires `--strip`).
- **Strip carousel (`--strip`):** the default template is **`strip_mural_v2`**. Any other template (polaroid, seamless, mural v1, 10 columns) needs **`--strip-template <id>`** — see `TEMPLATE_IDS` in `crates/core/src/registry.rs` and `.cursor/rules/after-changes-strip-export.mdc` for examples.

Windows: use the MSVC toolchain (`rustup default stable-msvc`). No Python venv or Pillow.
